## Implementation Plan

### Phase 1: Quick Test (5 minutes)
```bash
cd /workspaces/json-gui-addon-kit
git checkout makefile-migration

# Test 1: Change FLASH origin
sed -i 's/ORIGIN = 0x08000000/ORIGIN = 0x00000000/' ld/ch32v003f4p6.ld

# Rebuild
PREFIX=~/.platformio/packages/toolchain-riscv/bin/riscv-wch-elf- make clean
PREFIX=~/.platformio/packages/toolchain-riscv/bin/riscv-wch-elf- make slave

# Check result
~/.platformio/packages/toolchain-riscv/bin/riscv-wch-elf-size build/gfx_slave.elf
```

**Expected**: Binary size should drop to ~16,300-16,400 bytes ✓

### Phase 2: If Still Overflowing (10 minutes)
```bash
# Remove picolibc, use nano.specs
# Edit Makefile:
# 1. Remove -I$(PICOLIBC_INC) and picolibc defines
# 2. Add -specs=nano.specs -specs=nosys.specs to LDFLAGS_BASE
# 3. Remove -s flag

PREFIX=~/.platformio/packages/toolchain-riscv/bin/riscv-wch-elf- make clean
PREFIX=~/.platformio/packages/toolchain-riscv/bin/riscv-wch-elf- make slave
```

**Expected**: Should fit within 16KB ✓

### Phase 3: Fine Tuning (if needed)
- Add aggressive optimization flags one by one
- Test each build
- Document which flags provide best results

